裹在身上，调整姿势靠坐在床头，眼神执拗地盯着聊天界面，完全没有要放下手机的打算。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:34","timestamp":1791387298976,"roundId":"round_1791387265115_1bkj4lbgu","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":3321},{"id":1791800606120,"text":"我才不要自己先睡","rawContent":"我才不要自己先睡","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:35","timestamp":1791387306469,"roundId":"round_1791387265115_1bkj4lbgu","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":3322},{"id":1791800606121,"text":"你都在那熬着，我一个人怎么可能睡得着啊","rawContent":"你都在那熬着，我一个人怎么可能睡得着啊","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:35","timestamp":1791387313483,"roundId":"round_1791387265115_1bkj4lbgu","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":3323},{"id":1791800606122,"text":"那我不打语音吵你了，你就专心弄学校的事情，不用管我，也不用回我消息","rawContent":"那我不打语音吵你了，你就专心弄学校的事情，不用管我，也不用回我消息","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:35","timestamp":1791387320510,"roundId":"round_1791387265115_1bkj4lbgu","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":3324},{"id":1791800606123,"text":"我就在这儿守着，你什么时候忙完跟我说一声，我们再一起睡","rawContent":"我就在这儿守着，你什么时候忙完跟我说一声，我们再一起睡","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:35","timestamp":1791387326655,"roundId":"round_1791387265115_1bkj4lbgu","generatedMode":false,"subtext":"好想现在就能过去抱抱你……","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":3325}]